// COVERS DuckDBLexerGrammar: DuckDB, path
//
// Every token DuckDBLexerGrammar.g4 declares -- the whole grammar is two keywords, and
// duckDBDatasourceSpecification admits exactly one element. Syntax from legend-engine's
// TestDuckDBConnectionGrammarRoundtrip.testDuckDbDatabaseConnection.
//
// `path` is optional (`( path )*`), so `specification: DuckDB { }` also parses; it is
// written here because the COVERS claim has to appear in the code.
###Connection
RelationalDatabaseConnection fixture::t2::DuckDBFull
{
  store: fixture::t2::Db;
  type: DuckDB;
  specification: DuckDB
  {
    path: '/test';
  };
  auth: Test;
}
